    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. linkers/ipc.py:706-727 and 814-835 build IpcPattern(type=send, line=0); the event_publishes edge leaves the send detected at its real line (preload.js:3-3:send:open-file), and the 0-0 node has no outgoing edge. Reproduced on a 3-file Electron fixture. v03."  # 8432
