- op: discuss  # 844c
  at: '2026-11-01T02:26:27Z'  # 844c
  by: agent  # 844c
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 844c
  clock: 4  # 844c
  nonce: 844c  # 844c
  message: "Fixed in PR #1983 (277f56df99 on dev). Root cause: both contextBridge sites in link_ipc built the calls-edge target as a new IpcPattern(line=0), because bridge detection recorded no line. Bridge detection now records the IPC call line, the bridge edge targets the send detected at that file/line/channel, and a wrapper send with no detected counterpart joins main itself; no line-0 stand-in remains. Live repro on merged dev: hypergumbo survey on the 3-file Electron fixture: rc=0, path onClick -> ipc:src/renderer.js:2-2:api.openFile:bridge_caller -> ipc:src/preload.js:3-3:send:open-file -> ipc:src/main.js:2-2:receive:open-file exists; zero ipc: nodes at 0-0 (before: target preload.js:0-0, no outgoing edge). Tests: TestContextBridgeChainConnectivity (5, all red before). Residual filed: WI-pumit (main-side ipcHandle wrapper not a receiver; podman-desktop 65 of 66 callers stop at preload)."  # 844c
